A||||26||loafer87gt||I don't understand our government||||8||
Z||000000||loafer87gt||11-08-2001||05:58 PM||||I just don't get what goes through the heads of our politicans. Today our Liberal government stated it's concern for the Afghani people, and vowed to lead all other nations to supply aid to the people. He said this means more air drops of supplies, and making it easier for Afghani refugees to take shelter in Canada. Meanwhile, we are out there dropping bombs along with the other allies on the country of Afghanistan. This makes no sense at all, why the hell should we spend more of our tax dollars to supply food and supplies to these people, only making them a stronger opposition to our soldiers. I also can't understand why the heck we should open our gates to let more of these people into our country allowing them a safe place to plan their next wave of attacks. Undoubtebly we as the taxpayers would have to foot the bill for all the medical and educational costs that come along with the refugees. It really pisses me off that Canada as a country is so short of funds that it can't even look after it's own peoples needs, (ever tried to get medical attention in Canada) yet it seems our government can always find funding to help some little piss-ant country. As far as I'm concerned, we should be providing no aid to the Afghani people if we are at war with their government. If the people are hungry and need supplies, why the heck don't they revolt and overthrow the ruling Taliban; the group responsible for their plight. It just doesn't make sense to me.||||reg||8
Z||000001||Mach10||11-08-2001||06:11 PM||||You're missing the point. Canada is assisting the US in bombing the TALIBAN. Not all Talibans are Afghani (many are pakistani) and by NO stretch of the imagination are all Afghanis all Talibans...<P>Hit the ones that need hitting... Jeez.||||reg||4
Z||000002||frontal lobe||11-08-2001||06:18 PM||||It's very difficult for us "westerners" to know which muslims just want to practice their own religion, and leave others practice theirs in peace; vs. which ones don't think it's fine to be non-muslim and are willing to kill any "christian" or "jew".<P>I have no objection to befriending and helping afghani's and pakistani's that are in the first group, but undoubtedly some of the aid will go to the second group and possibly enable them to later attack us.  How do you identify which is which?||||reg||1
