Z||000004||maryjane||11-08-2001||08:38 PM||||You answered your own questions with the first 4 words of the second sentence. "Today our Liberal government...". They're trying to stay on the fence with their voters. Trying to have their cake & eat it too. I hate to see civilian suffering in combat, but we didn't start this one. Dropping food is not going to help the Taliban, but can't hurt what little support we might have there either. You can drop a lot of food packets for what a daisy cutter costs. I've heard tho, that the Taliban is trying to keep the needy from getting the food, sending it to the front lines instead.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Mach10||11-08-2001||08:48 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by maryjane:<BR><B>You answered your own questions with the first 4 words of the second sentence. "Today our Liberal government...". They're trying to stay on the fence with their voters. Trying to have their cake & eat it too. I hate to see civilian suffering in combat, but we didn't start this one. Dropping food is not going to help the Taliban, but can't hurt what little support we might have there either. You can drop a lot of food packets for what a daisy cutter costs. I've heard tho, that the Taliban is trying to keep the needy from getting the food, sending it to the front lines instead.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Uh, MJ: Liberal means something COMPLETELY different up here...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>We have the option of the Liberals, the Alliance, or the Tories  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><BR>Liberals: Well rounded, and realistic<BR>Alliance: Show-boating clown that made the mistake of forcing his orthodox christian views to his voters.... Much to the enjoyment of many a Cannuck when he was telling the press about how people were walking with Dinosaurs  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Tories: Don't even go there... Party of deranged monkeys... Gave us the national GST tax, to alleviate debt... Didn't work. Where the hell's that 7% on EVERYTHING going?!?<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Mach10 (edited 11-08-2001).]||||reg||10
