 to say. Probably not   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>As far as the economics go, my choice of wording was wrong. You are right. The economy pretty much does it's own thing. My focus was on spending/budget/surplus/deficit<BR>The liberals, although some "trimming" was done in their early terms, they are starting to dump money back into the programs that the people want. I've had $900 knocked off my tuition. Hospitals are getting equipment/nurses. Things are looking up, even as our dollar slips lower   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">[/B][/QUOTE]<P>||||reg||1
